{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tragic and romantic dark fantasy puzzle game where shadows eclipse the light and mysteries lie waiting to be illuminated. Solve occult-themed puzzles relying on intuition and exploration. Uncover cryptic clues and deep mysteries.\u00a0 Set in the Realm of Mirrors within the sprawling continent of Miras - a world of diverse kingdoms and cultures - shards of the once powerful Ruunic Empire, now broken and severed from the Light.\u00a0<br><br>Journey to Miras and uncover a dark plot weaved from the depths of time immemorial. Aid a mysterious traveler and resolve a cosmic rift between a troubled cast of characters, using your wits to illuminate secrets imbued within the world and narrative itself. Choose wisely and set right the wrongs of the past.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990200?t=1770048552","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990200/821ac73fe1c396ce20a446fd9ed9dc52e44fd9f9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770048552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990200/cdd2a6b64772ca9dd044489c49e60f4cb742dc64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770048552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990200/cdd2a6b64772ca9dd044489c49e60f4cb742dc64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770048552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"In-game dialogue deals with mature themes of trauma, slavery, sex trafficking, and abuse. Implied consumption of alcohol."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tragic and romantic dark fantasy puzzle game where shadows eclipse the light and mysteries lie waiting to be illuminated. Solve occult-themed puzzles relying on intuition and exploration. Uncover cryptic clues and deep mysteries.\u00a0 Set in the Realm of Mirrors within the sprawling continent of Miras - a world of diverse kingdoms and cultures - shards of the once powerful Ruunic Empire, now broken and severed from the Light.\u00a0<br><br>Journey to Miras and uncover a dark plot weaved from the depths of time immemorial. Aid a mysterious traveler and resolve a cosmic rift between a troubled cast of characters, using your wits to illuminate secrets imbued within the world and narrative itself. Choose wisely and set right the wrongs of the past.</p>","developers":["Crimson Lune"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990200/f65a43625e544b0dec5af89e40c1dc1d5bf6e46a/header.jpg?t=1770048552","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3990200/1647762180/980cdfd0c86291f3272ad3599f1dab2bb777a030/1756246769/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756869624","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3990200/1647762180/980cdfd0c86291f3272ad3599f1dab2bb777a030/1756246769/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756869624","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3990200/1647762180/980cdfd0c86291f3272ad3599f1dab2bb777a030/1756246769/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756869624","id":257189364,"name":"Crimson Tower - Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189364/4cc4cbfb40e8c14ea1f6f3e7d3db906dccd5fd31/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17